Just recently, after another stupid death due to drowning, I thought of
a tool(?) that would make the game easier...  scuba gear!  It would
be expensive if found in a shop, you would have to have a certain
dexterity to use it correctly, and it would have a limited time to use 
it before it runs out of air.  A scroll of charging would have the 
effect of restoring the air in the tanks...  

This would make fighting the kraken and getting into the castle somewhat
easier, depending on how rare the scuba gear is.  Of course, you would
still have to remember to put on the gear before going into the water,
and if you don't take it off after getting back on land, you keep using
the air inside it...  
